# Allow-list for any `vercel deploy` run from the REPO ROOT (S18 V1).
# The only deployable surface of this repo is web/ (a Vite SPA). Everything else (app/, data/,
# eval/, ops/, reports/, the Python project files) must never be uploaded. Production deploys
# come from git push to main (CLAUDE rule 31a), so this is a safety net for accidental CLI runs.
# Syntax is gitignore-style; tests/test_vercelignore.py checks it with `git check-ignore`.
/*
!/web
/web/node_modules
/web/dist
/web/.vercel
/web/.env
/web/.env.*
